Package: galaxyxr-audio
Architecture: all
Depends: alsa-ucm-conf, alsa-utils, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: galaxyxr-base-partitions, galaxyxr-firmware (>= 7~)
Description: Galaxy XR sound card setup for mainline kernels
 The AudioReach topology that the kernel loads for the Galaxy XR's sound
 card, the ALSA UCM profile that tells PipeWire about its speakers,
 microphones and DisplayPort audio, and a service that gives the speaker
 amplifiers' protection firmware the unit's factory calibration.
